<article class="about">
    <h1>About TheBluesland</h1>
    <p>
        I'm Mehmet, and TheBluesland is a place to share my Spotify playlists.
        Blues and rock are at the heart of the collection, alongside folk, jazz, soul,
        electronic music, and the connections between them.
    </p>
    <p>
        Some playlists stay with one artist or a particular sound. Others bring together music
        for a long drive, a quiet evening, or a change of mood. There are tributes, film-inspired
        selections, and mixes that wander across genres.
    </p>
    <p>
        Each playlist has a short note to give you a feel for the music before you press play.
        Browse by mood, genre, occasion, or era, explore the <a href="/collections">collections</a>,
        or head straight to <a href="/">all playlists</a>. When something catches your ear,
        open it in Spotify and listen.
    </p>
</article>
